’s new:\n- Hold-to-use Aimbot & Triggerbot — enable the feature, then hold its assigned key to activate.\n- Custom keybinds for feature switches and action buttons, saved with your config.\n- Hands & Weapon Customization — separate colors, transparency, materials, reflectance, and texture removal.\n- Map Customization — colors, materials, rainbow effects, and a magenta visual preset.\n- Expanded Chams — separate fill and outline colors, transparency, and pulse effects.\n- Sky Changer — custom six-face skyboxes with texture loading checks.\n- World Settings — time, brightness, exposure, fog controls, and color grading.\n- Custom Crosshair & HUD — adjustable reticle and live client information.\nAlso included:\nESP with boxes, skeletons, health bars, names, distance, tracers, and rainbow colors. Aimbot target selection, FOV settings, smoothing, and visibility checks. Triggerbot reaction delay, Bunny Hop, Anti Flash, Anti Smoke, Third Person, and an active keybind list.\nSkin Changer has been removed.\nPress K to open or close the menu. Currently keyless; a key system is planned for a future update.\nExecutor notice: Tested on Xeno only. Compatibility with other executors has not been verified. RAC bans have been reported on Potassium and some other executors immediately after executing the script. No anti-ban protection is guaranteed.","tags":["esp","aimbot","chams","free","keyless"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/9ccyCRnr8P","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"6a2988e9909c503c14cdca23","username":"megapxzeeoh","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/2144355afc8d1e435bf98c331a54d7e9542fcf78f6566d4ca121aa5a5c59c71a.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6a2988e9909c503c14cdca23-1788546443000.jpg"},"lvl":4,"status":"offline","id":"6a2988e9909c503c14cdca23","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/2144355afc8d1e435bf98c331a54d7e9542fcf78f6566d4ca121aa5a5c59c71a.webp","original":"ht